  <summary>&lt;p>Gemini-Kchat is a KDE Plasma plasmoid that brings Google's Gemini AI directly to your desktop. Chat, code, and control files without leaving your panel.&lt;br />Features:&lt;br />- Direct chat with Google Gemini AI from your Plasma panel&lt;br />- File Operations: list directories, read/write files, run shell commands&lt;br />- Session persistence with multiple chat history management&lt;br />- Multi-provider TTS: ElevenLabs, OpenAI, espeak-ng, Piper, Speech Note&lt;br />- Markdown rendering with syntax-highlighted code blocks&lt;br />- Customizable UI: themes, fonts, placeholders, and function messages&lt;br />- Full color customization for chat bubbles, inputs, and code&lt;br />Requirements:&lt;br />- KDE Plasma 6.0 or later&lt;br />- Google AI Studio API key (free at &lt;a href="https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey">https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey&lt;/a>)&lt;/p></summary>
